 the Cache County Study</article-title><source>Int J Geriatr Psychiatry</source><month>9</month><year>2006</year><volume>21</volume><issue>9</issue><fpage>824</fpage><lpage>830</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16955439</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b13-jmdh-4-125"><label>13.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lyketsos</surname><given-names>CG</given-names></name><name><surname>Lopez</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Fitzpatrick</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>Breitner</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>DeKosky</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence of neuropsychiatric symptoms in dementia and mild cognitive impairment: results from the cardiovascular health study</article-title><source>JAMA</source><month>9</month><day>25</day><year>2002</year><volume>288</volume><issue>12</issue><fpage>1475</fpage><lpage>1483</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12243634</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b14-jmdh-4-125"><label>14.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Grossman</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergmann</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Parker</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dementia: a brief review</article-title><source>Mt Sinai J Med</source><month>11</month><year>2006</year><volume>73</volume><issue>7</issue><fpage>985</fpage><lpage>992</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17195884</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b15-jmdh-4-125"><label>15.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Crooks</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name><name><surname>Geldmacher<